  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "GpuAdvisor is a critical service responsible for diagnosing and resolving GpuMemoryError exceptions when loading large language models. It queries system state via nvidia-smi to identify memory consumers and offers actionable choices to the user. It orchestrates recovery by allowing the user to use existing JARVIS servers or by automatically attempting to load the model partially onto the GPU using binary search optimization."
  },
